+/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ * Record access. Lists are ASUS-convention "<r1<r2<r3", fields '>'-separated.
+ * Everything is read through a loaded config snapshot rather than nvram_get at
+ * emit time, so a rollback can generate from /jffs lastgood using exactly the
+ * same code path as a live apply (S3: rollback must not be a second, less-
+ * tested implementation of apply).
+ * ------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
